                                "sense_id": "0a8688aa-fc88-34d3-baf8-918f24be9126",
                                "text": "Fantastic, superb, brilliant, bloody marvellous — I could go on and on calling out superlatives about Xenon 2. It's had enough pre-release hype to rival Batman and it's blown away all other Miggy shoot-'em-ups to date and I can safely say, for quite a while to come as well."
